## Error recovery

- **`service_cap_denied`** — widen key caps (`apikeys.create`) or use the alternate action named in the error.
- **`authorization_pending`** (Device Code) — keep polling (not an error).
- **Auth expired / 401** — run `/agentstack-login`.
- **HTTP 429 / rate limit** — honor `Retry-After` if present; otherwise exponential backoff (1s, 2s, 5s). Surface `X-Trace-Id`. Do **NOT** tight-loop.
- **Network / 5xx** — retry with backoff (100ms, 500ms, 2s). Surface `X-Trace-Id` via `/agentstack-diagnose`.
